Description: native, local and ad-free radio globe (unofficial radio.garden client)
 FREQUENZ shows the public place and station list of radio.garden on an
 OpenGL globe, plays live streams with GStreamer and keeps a local catalog
 for instant search. It is an unofficial client: station data belongs to
 radio.garden and the broadcasters. There are no ads and no premium paths.
 .
 The station catalog downloads on first start. Run 'frequenz build-globe'
 once to add the land map.
